{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2013-07", "window": 4, "start_date": 1374624000, "end_date": 1375315199, "month_true_total": 26, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:47:57 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "465", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960269230", "personaname": "leXith", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/leXith/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 47, "playtime_forever": 614, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 565, "last_played": 1672720275, "avatar": "93cca1cff46db416319020744d1923a709f32dae"}, "language": "english", "review": "Played it, beat it, loved it.\n\nThen I noticed the multiplayer for wave-based ork bashing. <3\n\nIt's like Gear of War meets WarHammer 40K.\n\nGameplay is solid, story is enguaging enough to be somewhat relevant (as all Warhammer seems to be), and is overall very fun and enjoyable.\n\nHighly recommended.", "timestamp_created": 1375260665, "timestamp_updated": 1375260665, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "5088594", "author": {"steamid": "76561198044922040", "personaname": "Alboin", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198044922040/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 505, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 423, "last_played": 1430725980, "avatar": "1b9a990a11b3759829c5a424ccaf189cae0f41b5"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great story, lots of blood, gore and executions makes this simple game unforgettable. It is not hard but from time to time you will get one or two problems, which can be solved in couple of tries. And once you get hammer and jetpack, enemies will die in most horrible way just for pleasure of sight and evil grin.", "timestamp_created": 1375208187, "timestamp_updated": 1385413037, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.51628267765045166", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "616985", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973134961", "personaname": "n4tivo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fuentesa/", "num_games_owned": 671, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 869, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 869, "last_played": 1375073567, "avatar": "05f25d861992a3d9ea8162ff3e3bc6f1c0680d07"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Marine is a third person shooter based on the Warhammer IP that delivers every bit of action you would've expect from a Warhammer 40K game. Solid storyline, combat makes this game A MUST for Warhammer aficionados and fps player alike.", "timestamp_created": 1375073821, "timestamp_updated": 1375073821, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4668866", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040573839", "personaname": "Bread", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/breadallelogram/", "num_games_owned": 2349, "num_reviews": 307, "playtime_forever": 640, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 555, "last_played": 1430162972, "avatar": "61585d4fc353cab861445387df7160bd42d1ca40"}, "language": "english", "review": "Makes you feel like a big sluggish murder machine. There are so